# Innovation Case Studies

In this project, I looked at two technologies: 3D-printed jet engine parts and CubeSats. Both show how engineering can solve real problems by making technology more efficient, useful, and practical.

## 3D-Printed Jet Engine Parts

3D printing allows engineers to combine many separate jet engine parts into one part. This can make the part lighter, stronger, and easier to manufacture.

![3D printed jet engine parts](images/jetengine.jpg)

For this technology, I looked at the math, science, engineering, and machines needed to make it, as well as the problems it solves.
